Constraint: Tools and tables must be removed each evening

Garden room
Capacity: 32 people
Hire: €160 per evening
Access: Step-free entrance, 700 m from the bus station
Constraint: Tools can stay in a locked cupboard

All costs are provisional quotes for one evening; staffing and insurance are excluded.

## Audience and intention
The neighbourhood committee is explaining its provisional recommendation of Station hall because capacity and bus access matter most. Keep Garden room available for comparison. Include this supplied sentence verbatim: “The committee provisionally recommends Station hall for its capacity and bus access; booking is not approved.”
